    "    \"- Dataset shape and class balance\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Amount distributions (log-normal, fraud vs. legitimate)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Temporal patterns (hour-of-day, day-of-week, holiday effects)\\n\",\n",
